Date: Mon Nov  1 15:22:10 2004
Subject: [BioC] how to get mismatch probe coordinates
In-Reply-To: <F9E2F33A-2BA2-11D9-9F3A-000A95764B04@bu.edu>
References: <s18544d1.084@med-gwia-01a.med.umich.edu>
