From jmacdon at med.umich.edu  Tue Nov 23 18:44:59 2004
From: jmacdon at med.umich.edu (James W. MacDonald)
Date: Tue Nov 23 18:45:00 2004
Subject: [BioC] M vs. A plot
In-Reply-To: <41B24E75@webmail.utk.edu>
References: <41B24E75@webmail.utk.edu>
